          "AffiliationInfo": {"Affiliation": "Accident and Emergency Department, Bristol Royal Infirmary, U.K."}
        }
      },
      "ArticleTitle": "Morbidity after anterior cervical decompression and fusion. The influence of the donor site on recovery, and the results of a trial of surgibone compared to autologous bone.",
